    "text": "Yes. Saturday should be warm, around 22 degrees Celsius, but the afternoon might be rainy. The morning will be sunny according to the latest report.\n\nI would wait. A cloud can pass quickly, and the wind is moving it toward the hills. Let's plan for both possibilities.\n\nI will bring an umbrella and a cloth for the food. The cafe has room for eight people, and our group has only six.\n\nIf we hear thunder or see lightning, we will go straight inside. We can ask the cafe staff when it is safe to leave.\n\nI prefer spring. The climate here is mild, and even a windy day can feel pleasant. Today the humidity is high, though, so let us take plenty of water.\n\nThanks. I will check the new report at ten and call you if anything changes.",
